/issues/comments/3855033608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115842#issuecomment-3855033608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115842","id":3855033608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lxyUI","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T17:15:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T17:15:52Z","body":"> I don't really know what the use of those are\r\n\r\nI'd say that's a good indication that we should not add them.\r\n\r\nHost configuration for LSP should probably be removed (but well I don't want to deal with the compat mess). It was added under the premise of WSL support: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/52330 but the protocol really is not designed for cross platform operation and WSL has a lot of issues, so it's basically unsupported anyway.\r\n\r\nAs for threading, that's pretty relevant for LSP due to having long running actions like refactoring, for which we should not block the editor. Not sure if there is a similar need in DAP","author